WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:07.870
Hello, and welcome to the Unreal Engine training course, Control Rig Chaos Physics for Automotive.

2
00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:12.759
This course covers an overview of the Chaos vehicle system and its features.

3
00:00:12.759 --> 00:00:16.679
We'll be going over the steps you need to take to set up a Chaos vehicle in Unreal

4
00:00:16.679 --> 00:00:21.879
Engine version 5.5, some things to consider before you get into the engine, as well

5
00:00:21.879 --> 00:00:26.559
as a brief overview of some of the settings that you'd edit to tweak the feel and handling

6
00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:28.789
of your vehicle.

7
00:00:28.789 --> 00:00:32.210
So by the end of the course, you'll have a fully functional Chaos vehicle that you can

8
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:37.030
drive around the demo map and be able to take that knowledge and apply it to your own vehicles

9
00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:39.270
in your own projects.

10
00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:43.450
We'll first take a look at some of the Chaos vehicle's features and see what assets

11
00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:47.780
we need to get set up before we can start driving our vehicle around.

12
00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.359
Then we'll get into the engine and begin with our wheel blueprints.

13
00:00:51.359 --> 00:00:54.880
These are a super key part of the Chaos vehicle system where you configure a lot

14
00:00:54.880 --> 00:01:00.399
of the information for things like the wheel's attributes, the suspension and the brakes.

15
00:01:00.399 --> 00:01:04.760
And after that, we'll configure the physics asset, the animation blueprint and the vehicle

16
00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:05.760
blueprint.

17
00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:08.700
And we'll connect them all together so that our system has everything it needs to

18
00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:09.700
get moving.

19
00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:14.340
And once that's all ready, we're going to set up the controls for the car using

20
00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:19.560
enhanced input so that we can actually test drive what we've created.

21
00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:23.239
And then once our car's moving, we'll use Control Rig to get the suspension system

22
00:01:23.239 --> 00:01:26.980
animating in real time, reacting to the movement of the wheels.

23
00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:30.439
And lastly, we'll go over some of the settings that affect the vehicle's handling

24
00:01:30.439 --> 00:01:35.239
to give you a kickoff point to start tweaking and customizing your own vehicle settings,

25
00:01:35.239 --> 00:01:38.439
as well as some different setups that will help you get to project finality.
